a.c('artifact_verification','product.verify closed target sum','packed_artifact verifies supplied product/descriptor/contribution/artifact/content, declared dependency/compatibility, locally decidable native-contract truth and source-contract-indexed pending external selectors before resolution. installed_artifact verifies same truth with exactly one resolved lock, installed identity and install manifest.',[g(1,358,375)])
a.q('verification_phase_separation',['artifact_verification'],'Packed target forbids resolved lock, installed identity and install manifest; installed target requires all three. Verification neither constructs lock nor installs/binds/admits/invokes or treats unresolved external meaning as linked truth. Result retains target member, checked identities, local/installed disposition, packed pending external evidence, residual/refusal and provenance.',[g(1,358,375)])
